    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d596-a1">

                <pb facs="0719" n="617" sameAs="frus:frus1919v01/pg617"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure 1]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Agent of the Yokohama Specie Bank, Ltd</hi>. (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Ichinomiya</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Vice
                        President of the American International Corp</hi>. (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Tinsley</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >New York</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1918-04-02"><hi rendition="#italic">April 2,
                        1918</hi>.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Sir</hi>: Referring to our previous
                    correspondence relative to the loan to the Chinese Government, I am now in
                    receipt of a reply from the Industrial Bank of Japan to my cable in regard to
                    the above matter, in which they state as follows:— <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>Telegram received Industrial Bank of Japan will participate wire amount
                            and time of payment. Ono.</p>
                    </quote></p>
                <p>Will you kindly let me know at what time I may see you or Mr. Stone tomorrow in
                    regard to the above matter, and oblige,</p>
                <p>Yours very truly,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">R. Ichinomiya</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
